/-!
# Witness data for the two shear tests

Rows have bit j at column j; half-matrix words have bit `56*i+j` at (i,j).
These are literal witnesses, with no asserted rank or completeness. The
companion modules certify the identities actually used. Reproduced from the
published ATLAS forms by the script and sources described in source/README.md.
-/

